{
  "_readme": [
    "Explicit links from a name as a program writes it to the professor record it means.",
    "",
    "Both files quote their source and the sources disagree: a program page says 'Anna Lau'",
    "or 'Dr. Bohnert', that person's own bio page says 'Anna S. Lau' or 'Amy Bohnert'. Neither",
    "is wrong, so neither file is edited to match the other -- the link is recorded here instead,",
    "where it can be read and argued with.",
    "",
    "This replaces guessing at runtime. js/faculty.js still carries a fuzzy matcher for names",
    "added before anyone maps them, but with these in place every accepting name resolves",
    "exactly, so a star button can never attach to the wrong person.",
    "",
    "Key is school|||program|||name-as-the-program-writes-it. Value is the id in",
    "data/professors.json. Add an entry when a new accepting name does not resolve; the",
    "count is printed by every build.",
    "",
    "Checked by hand, not merely surname-matched: 'Raffles Cowan' at Michigan State is",
    "Henry Cowan -- the department's own announcement names him 'Dr. Henry (Raffles) Cowan'.",
    "'Lisa Velkoff' is 'Elizabeth (Lisa) A. Velkoff', 'Ali Cohen' is 'Alexandra \"Ali\" Cohen',",
    "'Heather Offutt' is 'Heather Kleider-Offutt', and 'Sarah Mattson' is 'Sarah Mattson Weller'."
  ],
